{"seq":2,"slug":"churchill-political-career","title":"温斯顿·丘吉尔：从政生涯","stage":"DONE","category":"winston-churchill","categoryLabel":"温斯顿·丘吉尔","chapterCount":3,"docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career","rating":{"composite":3.58,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":2.5,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/12_winston-churchill/2_churchill-political-career","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"温斯顿-丘吉尔-从政生涯\">温斯顿·丘吉尔：从政生涯</h1><p>温斯顿·伦纳德·斯宾塞-丘吉尔（Winston Leonard Spencer-Churchill，1874–1965）的政治生涯跨越逾六十年，是二十世纪英国宪政史上罕见的长度与跨度。他于 1900 年首次当选下议院议员，1964 年才最终退出议会，其间历任殖民地事务部副大臣、贸易委员会主席、内政大臣、海军大臣、军需大臣、陆军兼空军大臣、殖民地大臣、财政大臣，并两度出任首相。</p>\n<p>这条轨迹并非一条平稳上升的曲线，而是充满断裂、失势与复出的反复。1904 年他因抵制保守党的关税保护政策而&quot;穿越议会大厅&quot;加入自由党；1915 年达达尼尔海峡战役的失败几乎终结了他的部长生涯；1924 年他重返保守党并出任财政大臣；1929 至 1939 年的&quot;荒野岁月&quot;里，他被排除于内阁之外，却以反绥靖、主张重整军备的孤立姿态积蓄了道德资本。</p>\n<p>1940 年 5 月 10 日，丘吉尔在德军西线攻势之际临危受命，组建跨党派战时联合政府，以一系列演说凝聚了英国坚持抗战的意志。然而 1945 年 7 月的大选中，选民却把胜利的战时领袖逐出了唐宁街。1951 年他再度入主首相府，直至 1955 年 4 月以八十岁高龄退休。</p>\n<p>本卷以政党政治、官职履历与重大政策抉择为线索，按时间顺序梳理丘吉尔从政生涯的三个阶段：早期崛起与政党转向、两次大战之间的执政与失势、以及战时与战后的首相岁月。叙述力求以确切的日期、地点、文献与演说为据，呈现一个既被神话化又屡遭争议的政治人物的真实复杂性。</p>\n<p>读者将看到，丘吉尔的从政生涯既体现了英国议会制度下个人能动性的极限，也折射出自由贸易、阶级冲突、帝国存续与极权威胁等贯穿二十世纪上半叶的核心议题。理解他的官职更迭与立场转换，是理解那个时代英国政治的一把钥匙。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rise-and-party-realignment","title":"崛起与政党转向（1900–1924）","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/rise-and-party-realignment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entry-into-parliament-and-oldham","title":"初入议会：奥尔德姆与从政起点（1900）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/rise-and-party-realignment/entry-into-parliament-and-oldham"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crossing-the-floor-to-liberals","title":"穿越议会大厅：投向自由党（1904）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/rise-and-party-realignment/crossing-the-floor-to-liberals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"admiralty-and-dardanelles-crisis","title":"海军大臣与达达尼尔危机（1911–1915）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/rise-and-party-realignment/admiralty-and-dardanelles-crisis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interwar-office-and-wilderness","title":"两次大战之间：执政与荒野岁月","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/interwar-office-and-wilderness","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chancellor-gold-standard-general-strike","title":"财政大臣：金本位与总罢工（1924–1929）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/interwar-office-and-wilderness/chancellor-gold-standard-general-strike"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wilderness-years-and-appeasement","title":"荒野岁月与反绥靖（1929–1939）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/interwar-office-and-wilderness/wilderness-years-and-appeasement"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"wartime-and-postwar-premiership","title":"战时首相与战后政坛","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/wartime-and-postwar-premiership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"premiership-and-wartime-leadership","title":"1940 年出任首相与战时领导（1940–1945）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/wartime-and-postwar-premiership/premiership-and-wartime-leadership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"defeat-and-second-premiership","title":"1945 年落败与第二次首相任期（1945–1955）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/winston-churchill/churchill-political-career/wartime-and-postwar-premiership/defeat-and-second-premiership"}]}]}